{"uid":"2a70d88e148af60b","name":"test_the_chain_reopens_regardless_of_the_tasks_prior_terminal_status","fullName":"tests.test_cure_invalidates#test_the_chain_reopens_regardless_of_the_tasks_prior_terminal_status","historyId":"70258151707140c44f3d1174bcc1de0a","time":{"start":1791945947200,"stop":1791945947203,"duration":3},"description":"The re-open itself is still unconditional -- every pass, from any\n    prior terminal status, on the finding's `invalidates` prediction alone.\n    But since v0.23 requirement B.4 (task 008) that re-open is PROVISIONAL,\n    not final: once every cure task that named this record's baseline\n    reaches `completed`/`validated`, `state.records_pending_reconciliation`\n    plus `LoopSupervisor._reconcile_pre_cure_heads` may walk it straight\n    back to the very status asserted here through the declared un-reopen\n    edge, if the cure's real diff never touched the record's cited path.\n    This test only pins the re-open moment itself; it does not exercise\n    that later walk-back (see this same module's `test_a_cure_diff_that_\n    misses_the_cited_path_un_reopens_the_record` and its neighbours).\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>The re-open itself is still unconditional -- every pass, from any<br />\nprior terminal status, on the finding's <code>invalidates</code> prediction alone.<br />\nBut since v0.23 requirement B.4 (task 008) that re-open is PROVISIONAL,<br />\nnot final: once every cure task that named this record's baseline<br />\nreaches <code>completed</code>/<code>validated</code>, <code>state.records_pending_reconciliation</code><br />\nplus <code>LoopSupervisor._reconcile_pre_cure_heads</code> may walk it straight<br />\nback to the very status asserted here through the declared un-reopen<br />\nedge, if the cure's real diff never touched the record's cited path.<br />\nThis test only pins the re-open moment itself; it does not exercise<br />\nthat later walk-back (see this same module's <code>test_a_cure_diff_that_ misses_